{"3985590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Multiplicity Multiverse Management Co.", "steam_appid": 3985590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/da8d0237c549c7ed687c4eb6c12335b7.avif?t=1780836823\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z3-R0 was never meant to be a hero. Once just a scout robot for the <strong>Multiplicity Multiverse Management Co.</strong>, his only task was to observe and report. But when his ship <strong>crash-lands</strong> on a dying planet riddled with unstable anomalies, Z3-R0 is forced into a role he never trained for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the <strong>Multi-Beam-Tool</strong> and a new-found ability to <strong>duplicate himself</strong>, Z3-R0 must rely on copies of his own form to wield weapons, <strong>fight endless swarms</strong>, and cleanse unstable multiverse anomalies. While duplications take the fight to the enemy, Z3-R0’s job is to keep them alive, heal broken realities, and gather the resources needed to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With his loyal companion <strong>R0-B0</strong> and technical help from a genius engineer <strong>J3-NNY</strong>, together they embark on a desperate mission to cleanse the planet, rebuild a ship, and maybe… find a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/edb0b874e511bb11f854a05b69963a31.avif?t=1780836823\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/643b24ec5768783bb3da0be4e14a9eb5.poster.avif?t=1780836823\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/643b24ec5768783bb3da0be4e14a9eb5.webm?t=1780836823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/643b24ec5768783bb3da0be4e14a9eb5.mp4?t=1780836823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>RESTORE WHAT IS BROKEN WHILE EVERYTHING TRIES TO KILL YOU!</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Multi-Beam-Tool</strong> to heal fractured anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk your life</strong> in the crossfire as enemies swarm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness explosive <strong>chain reactions</strong> when reality stabilizes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/b7d90ae9895589ed8ac5bc5b9ac64f2b.avif?t=1780836823\" width=1170 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/ae08b941205099bb4a6b7f585c4c73e9.poster.avif?t=1780836823\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/ae08b941205099bb4a6b7f585c4c73e9.webm?t=1780836823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985590/extras/ae08b941205099bb4a6b7f585c4c73e9.mp4?t=1780836823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>COMMAND YOUR DUPLICATION ARMY AND SHAPE YOUR PLAYSTYLE!</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn new <strong>duplications</strong> 